# Runtime droppings from running the standalone (or the test suite) in the project root: LogWriter
# writes to <currentdir>/tomcat/logs, and OpenmrsUtil resolves the search index marker to
# <currentdir>/appdata/lucene, which OpenmrsUtilTest creates and removes unless the JVM is killed
# mid-test. Both untracked and easy to sweep into a `git add -A`.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash, or these would also match nested paths: unanchored `tomcat/` hid
# src/main/config/tomcat/conf/ from `git add`, so a new file there was silently skipped while the
# six already-tracked ones stayed visible. Artifact copies of both live under target/, ignored above.
/tomcat/
/appdata/
